# The whole game, played by the demo player with real button presses from
# the title: the board, every briefing, all four cities and the Caldera,
# through to the ending (about 25 minutes of play: the Caldera, a second
# half, about as long as the four cities together).
seed 3
game echounit
wait 10
botuntil cleared0 == 1 30000
botuntil cleared1 == 1 30000
botuntil cleared2 == 1 30000
botuntil cleared3 == 1 40000
botuntil finale == 1 3000
botuntil state == 12 70000
expect won == 1
expect goals & 2
botuntil state == 0 3000
